## 1. Purpose and Scope

This policy sets the minimum requirements for accepting, storing, handling and shipping hazardous materials ("hazmat") through {{ f.company.name }} facilities and carriers. It applies to HPL staff, customers tendering hazmat to HPL, and every carrier transporting hazmat on HPL's behalf. It supplements, and does not replace, applicable U.S. Department of Transportation hazardous materials regulations.

